BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Enforcement starts with finding the debtor and then the money. Eric Nano works outward from what the case already) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (produced: where the debtor lived during the suit, the service address on a default, and contact details from trial or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (settlement. Under the FDCPA, the creditor can ask friends and family only for location, such as a forwarding address,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (and must leave them alone once the debtor is found; mutual friends who no longer like the debtor are flagged as prime) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (sources, alongside Google, White Pages and public social media, with professionals holding subscription databases too) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (expensive for individuals [bX8Hhszjuxs @ 00:04:02]. The Private Investigator Videos operator then locks the debtor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (into a financial disclosure or examination under penalty of perjury and runs an independent asset search to compare the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (two [q-khGCaOPck @ 00:02:10]. Steven Rinold hands operators a ready-made question list: the federal bankruptcy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (schedules of assets and liabilities, used as a post-judgment discovery checklist [R3nWxu374QE @ 00:11:32]. Will of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Downs Law specifies the document haul: tax returns, bank account information and other assets [K1KakWduA04 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (00:01:34]. Any gap between the sworn statement and the search becomes the leverage point, since no-shows and liars) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (can be ordered to pay fees and produce tax returns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The cash tools carry hard numbers. The Sterling Firm prices a California wage levy at a $30 deposit, with the employer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (remitting 25% of net wages starting 10 days after service for up to 10 years; a bank levy is another $30 deposit with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (bank remitting within 10 days, and collected funds are held 21 days [UV-WyQ1-NC4 @ 00:04:15]. Hendershot Cowart) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (separates the Texas writ of garnishment, which targets a known bank and exempts only current wages the debtor can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (prove the balance equals, from the broader turnover order, which can be served on any bank that then searches for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (debtor's accounts itself [-kyDpaMUqFY @ 00:01:03]. Timothy Anenberger's Mississippi practice treats a bank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (garnishment as a lien from service plus 30 days and serves banks even when nobody is sure an account exists) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm ([R3nWxu374QE @ 00:14:54]. LawShelf supplies the federal ceiling: CCPA Title III caps wage garnishment at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (lesser of 25% of disposable earnings or earnings above 30 times the federal minimum wage, with support orders,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (federal tax debt and Department of Education loans potentially outside the cap [fQZc8moX-c4 @ 00:01:13]. Business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (targets cost more under the Sterling schedule: an $85 till tap, a $300 keeper per 8 hours, and roughly $1,000 for a real) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (estate levy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (When the obvious accounts run dry, practitioners turn to pressure. Jeffrey Leon's playbook is to become a nuisance:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (depositions, subpoenas, account freezes that leave only a living-expense allowance, and credit-report hits, noting that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (recorded liens can trip mortgage defaults [R3nWxu374QE @ 00:19:30]. Scott Bernstein lays out the escalation ladder) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (against a stonewalling debtor: an order to compel, then contempt with daily fines, then a civil arrest warrant) Tj ET
