BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.55 Tm (The first trap is the exam itself. The Sacramento County Public Law Library warns that ordering a debtor in tips them) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.33 Tm (off. Money can migrate to a different bank before the creditor moves, so levies have to follow quickly once questioning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.10 Tm (exposes where the cash sits [HrhPbWDRBVU @ 00:05:46]. Service is the second choke point. Fitzgerald & Campbell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.88 Tm (stress that the order must be personally served, not mailed, because the exam compels both appearance and documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.65 Tm (showing where the debtor banks, works, lives, and what they own [rSqWVX1naKw @ 00:00:25]. People Locator Skip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 91.43 Tm (Tracing treats current address information from a professional skip trace as a prerequisite to landing that service at all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 76.20 Tm ([leX2BIpiyNQ @ 00:00:33]. Courtroom 1401 at the Daley Center spells out what a sloppy packet costs. Incorrect) Tj ET
