BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (service means re-service, and the citation stays inactive until it is served. A failed personal service requires an alias) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (citation, and an unserved citation cannot be continued, so a continuance order is wasted paper [RHS2h5dUkHk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (00:04:15]. The same courtroom denies relief to anyone ignoring its standing orders and requires Attachments A and E) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (inside the served packet. Every week lost to a bad address or a defective packet hands the debtor another week to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (reposition money.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (The second trap is a question worded too narrowly. On AceOfCoins, an advisor coaches a caller who opened an LLC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (solely in the caller's own name ahead of Colorado interrogatories. The advisor says the entity can stay off the answers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (unless a question names it, then states flatly, 'I'll lie if they can never discover it' [3qP0K9KK5G8 @ 00:03:37]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (same advisor recommends adding a family member to turn the entity into a 'nominee LLC,' so a creditor's writ reaches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (only the caller's distributions [3qP0K9KK5G8 @ 00:04:56]. Santiago Cueto sees the same moves from the creditor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (side: debtors lie, drive leased Mercedes, and park a million-dollar home in a spouse's name. In one example, a debtor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (deeded a home to a spouse the day after judgment. Cueto attacks those moves with Uniform Voidable Transactions Act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (claims and with reverse veil piercing built on commingling, ignored formalities, or personal use of company funds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm ([W9UHSaFUIn8 @ 00:05:54]. People Locator Skip Tracing counters with systematic coverage of every asset category.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (The exam then produces either the asset or 'a record of denial' that sets up a perjury or fraudulent transfer case) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm ([6mK0uU9RBO8 @ 00:00:00]. Examiners who ask explicitly about every LLC, every entity held by family, and every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (transfer close that gap.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (The third trap is spending hard on a thin file or losing the bench. Mr. Grey Judgment Enforcement ran a four bank levy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (strategy on a drunk-driving judgment. The speaker then summed up the proceeds as 'maybe we'll be able to buy a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (couple of burgers,' with no dollar figure given [499-NK9hWnc @ 00:01:40]. The same operator dealt with a Tempe) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (creditor holding a Craigslist rental-scam judgment against a landlord who 'doesn't own the property.' The speaker told) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (the creditor 'we're never gonna collect,' refused the requested 50/50 split because the case sat low on the totem pole,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (and countered with 'just give me the judgment' [09e6Gzw3S0U @ 00:00:20]. Robert S. Bernstein on Five Minute Legal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Master Series has clients pay discovery costs in advance or agree to reimburse them, noting that many states let those) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (costs and fees be added to the judgment [_O0Yt0qGF-k @ 00:04:11]. Courtroom conduct carries its own bill. In a) Tj ET
