BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The third split is what a judgment lien can reach and whether it survives the debtor's exit routes. Kralick says that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (where a married debtor owns real estate with a spouse as tenants by the entirety, there is no judgment lien against that) Tj ET
