BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (almost completely erased like it never existed. The unit economics are the point. A low-dollar file with a fax letter and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (two missed obligations funds the attorney, the affiliate, and a near-total debt wipe for the client.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Once a file goes to suit, John Watts lays out the procedural rhythm. He files in state court 99.9 percent of the time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (because of Spokeo standing arguments, and defendants, who get 30 days to answer or remove, remove 99.9 percent of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (the time [Ce0D7z4zJFo @ 00:00:30]. Motions to dismiss are often baseless because 'it makes the lawyers money,' so he) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (usually amends the complaint as of right instead. Discovery then runs through interrogatories, document requests,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (requests for admission, and depositions, followed by summary judgment with damages usually left to the jury) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm ([Ce0D7z4zJFo @ 00:03:32]. At trial he calls the collector's own witnesses, and the collector's motion for judgment as a) Tj ET
