BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (records including billing, because the collector is not required to itemize under 'G' of the FDCPA, then pulls an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (insurance accounting of what was paid; he routinely finds double billing and code changes [n3SZjPQDSHc @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (00:41:14]. Host Hannah Locklear was charged $16 for one ibuprofen pill and got the debt lowered after demanding an) Tj ET
